{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/875","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/875/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/875/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/875/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/875","id":5808309078,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABWjPDVg","number":875,"title":"Na2HPO4 x 7 H2O carries its own CAS 7782-85-6: decide §3 step 2 promotion (the #863 ledger row must move with it)","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10370025893,"node_id":"LA_kwDORhCjFc8AAAACahoJpQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-10-12T04:19:07Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T09:36:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Found in the second review of #863.\n\n`data/ingredients/mapped/Na2hpo4_X_7_H2o.yaml` has the local identity `kgmicrobe.compound:na2hpo4_x_7_h2o`. It was minted on 2026-08-13 under MAPPING_SEMANTICS §3 step 3, which covers \"no exact term and no CAS\". The record now carries `cas_rn: 7782-85-6`, the heptahydrate's own CAS. The x3 and x6 sibling records that shared it in the #334 scramble no longer carry it, and #863's unified snapshot publishes it on the `Na2HPO4·7H2O` row.\n\n§3 step 2 says that when there is no exact term but the substance has its own CAS, `identifier` should be `cas:<its own CAS>`, with a broadMatch to the nearest parent and the Rule B1 registry row. Open semantic-review finding SEM:cb9ec35166086d936f70 already asks for \"exact CAS promotion\" on this record.\n\n**Coupling with #863.** #863 adds a rejection-ledger row keyed (`kgmicrobe.compound:na2hpo4_x_7_h2o`, CHEBI:34683). A promotion to `cas:7782-85-6` must update that row's `mim_id` in the same change. Otherwise claw's `load_mapping_rejections` fails closed with \"rejection disagrees with MIM identity\".\n\n**To do:**\n1. Verify 7782-85-6 against an authoritative source for disodium hydrogen phosphate heptahydrate.\n2. If it is confirmed, promote the record under §3 step 2 through the SSSOM receipt chain, update the ledger row in the same commit, and rebuild the unified snapshot.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/875/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}